{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/marquis-insignia-marquis-arjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":577,"crm_id":"741","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Marquis Insignia","slug":"marquis-insignia-marquis-arjan","display_address":"Arjan","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Marquis","price":1181048,"display_price":"1.181M","lattitude":25.0607243,"longitude":55.2307222,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Marquis Insignia is a luxury project from Dubai developer Marquis, located in the picturesque Arjan area. The complex offers a wide selection of exquisite <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong>, the architecture of which is a captivating combination of royal charm and modern design, offering the epitome of luxurious comfort. The layout of each apartment is carefully thought out, with a harmonious combination of light shades providing functionality.</p><p>On the territory of the complex, residents can find many amenities that make life comfortable and convenient: children's and adult pools, jogging paths, a children's playground, a basketball court, an outdoor cinema, a yoga studio, as well as a picturesque landscaped garden with barbecue areas and recreational areas.</p><p>The vibrant and expanding Arjan district creates the conditions for an exciting experience away from the hectic rhythm of urban life, but a short drive from Dubai's entertainment, shopping and business centers. A medical hospital is within walking distance, a butterfly garden is 8 minutes away, and Dubai Marina and the Museum of the Future are 23 minutes away.</p><p>Marquis is a place where modern style is combined with elegance and comfort to provide residents with an unsurpassed lifestyle. The impressive architecture and unique design make this residential complex a